+
+Embedded fixed textures and texture-handle arrays retain the multisample bit
+from AIR's declared element shape through materialization. Their `read` sample
+index is emitted as `Sample`, not a single-sample `Lod`; reflected image shape
+and the GPU token table retain that same distinction.
 
